    "scope": {
      "zh": "仅收录2026款Plus 510智享版。官方车型名为AION Y Plus、配置名为「2026款510智享版」，与汽车之家78766「2026款 Plus 510 智享版」精确对应，国内指导价亦经交叉核对。指导价仅用于识别配置，不是出口报价或现货承诺。参数与装备按官方唯一配置列核对，不混用AION i60、AION Y其他续航或配置。官方仅注明17寸规格标注，完整轮胎规格未列出；零百加速、最高车速、变速箱、驱动形式、整备质量、座位数和方向盘位置未列明，保持空值。电池58.9/58.4 kWh两种版本随机供应、不支持指定，需核对实车资料。510km为CLTC测试续航；24分钟为30%至80%快充测试值，非实际使用保证；12.9 kWh/100km未注明测试循环。侧气囊、ETC和非全尺寸备胎为选装，选装备胎后取消补胎瓶；定速巡航不是自适应巡航，倒车影像不是360度影像。中国市场车机互联、ETC及联网服务在出口目的地的可用性须核实；国内三电保修有车主身份、非营运及年行驶里程限制，不自动适用于出口。",
      "en": "Only the MY2026 Plus 510 Zhixiang trim is listed. The manufacturer's model name AION Y Plus, and its sole '2026 510 Zhixiang' column match Autohome specification 78766, '2026 Plus 510 Zhixiang'. The domestic guide price was also cross-checked to identify the trim; it is not an export quotation or confirmation of stock. Specifications and equipment come from this official column, with no carryover from AION i60 or other AION Y versions. Only a 17-inch size designation is published, not the full tyre size. Unlisted acceleration, top speed, transmission, driven wheels, curb weight, seating capacity and steering-wheel position remain blank. The 58.9/58.4 kWh battery versions are supplied at random; the battery version cannot be selected; verify the actual vehicle's documentation. The 510 km range is measured on CLTC; 24 minutes is the tested 30–80% fast-charge time, not a real-world guarantee. No test cycle is stated for 12.9 kWh/100 km consumption. Side airbags, ETC and the space-saver spare wheel are optional; selecting the spare removes the tyre-repair bottle. Conventional cruise control is not adaptive cruise, and the reversing camera is not a 360-degree camera system. Export-market compatibility of phone connectivity, ETC and connected services must be verified. Domestic battery/motor/control-system warranty conditions restrict owner status, commercial use and annual mileage and do not automatically apply overseas."
    },
